        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>12 Inch Offset Stainless Steel \"C\" Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 12\" contemporary \"C\" style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1\" round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. Clean contemporary design, great for your entry doors. For use on residential and commercial doors. Warm satin stainless steel finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for DJO1170-630 \"C\" Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Offset: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel, Solid Bar</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: <b>Satin Stainless Steel </b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Offset Stainless Steel C Pull",
                "description": "These 12 inch contemporary 'C' style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1 inch round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  Clean contemporary design, great for your entry doors.  For use on residential and commercial doors. Warm satin stainless steel finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
